      "writtenOn": "2026-07-14T17:18:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d say I have a soft preference for doing it unconditionally. It places the responsibility for discovery responses more squarely on the EC. (I think it\u0027s not completely on the EC, because the PDC might respond from dead battery before the EC completes init.)",
      "parentUuid": "23780888_3e5a041e",
